# Scenario "house-exit" (US, milestone 8, playable game with replayed inputs): RUN IT WITH THE USER FOLDER OF "party"
# (tools/run.py --user-seed <party run>/user): the save made at the end of the first night. Title screen, Load Game,
# file 1 (LEFT then RIGHT: there and back, as in load-game.scn), the game resumes in the Chibi-House (stage 5).
# Chibi-Robo walks out down the stairs (stick down-right): stage 7, the living room, whose code is a REL module, so
# the game links stage07.rel (first OSLink of a new game); the first-visit cutscene and Telly's lines (A every 45
# frames), then stick up into the Chibi-House again (stage 5: OSUnlink of stage07), and out again (stick down: a
# second OSLink of stage07). Checks it with "--trace dvd -- --hle-trace" (play/README.md).
# Inputs written by hand from screenshots of native runs (cycle clock, RTC 800000000), no game data here.
# No A once Chibi-Robo is free in the Chibi-House: A next to the charger starts the ranking and save dialogue.
# Not run by tools/ab.py (progression scenario, see play/README.md). PAL version: play/GGTP01/house-exit.scn.
name house-exit
description With the save of "party": Load Game, leave the Chibi-House for the living room, come back, leave again.
version GGTE01
after party   # preparation: user folder (first save) left by "party"
window 0

input  450 A 10      # health and safety warning
input 1600 A 10      # title screen: Load Game
input 1850 LEFT 5    # file selection: file 1 -> file 3 (the cursor wraps around)
input 1900 RIGHT 5   # ... and back to file 1
input 1950 A 10      # load file 1
input 2150 SDOWN+SRIGHT 300   # Chibi-House: down the stairs, out to the living room
input 2650 A 5       # living room: Telly's lines
input 2695 A 5
input 2740 A 5
input 2785 A 5
input 2830 A 5
input 2875 A 5
input 2920 A 5
input 2965 A 5
input 3010 A 5
input 3055 A 5
input 3100 A 5
input 3300 SUP 200   # up the stairs into the Chibi-House
input 3600 SDOWN 250 # out again

check 1800 load-file-select
check 1890 cursor-file-3
check 1940 file-1-selected
check 2100 chibi-house
check 2200 exit-stairs
check 2300 living-room-loading
check 2400 living-room-cutscene
check 2700 telly-dialogue
check 3075 night-hint
check 3325 house-stairs
check 3400 chibi-house-loading
check 3550 back-in-chibi-house
check 3650 exit-again
check 3700 living-room-loading-again
check 3825 living-room-again

end 3900
